0..70 Comment "// The syntax model of `theory LC`, written as a `Model(LC)` module: a"
71..144 Comment "// context is its length, a substitution between two contexts is an `Env`"
145..222 Comment "// and a term in one a `Term`; each operation builds the syntax, ignoring the"
223..300 Comment "// context indices the derivation adds, and each law is the path its own file"
301..325 Comment "// proves of the syntax."
